---
description: Canonical repo rules for ai-gen-free
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` before writing code. Then `docs/adr/` and `docs/architecture.md`.

- Monorepo: `apps/web` UI only, `apps/api` HTTP, `apps/worker` jobs, domain in `packages/core`.
- Browser session: NextAuth. OTP/single-session stay in the API. Not Firebase. Not `localStorage` JWT.
- UI: Mantine. No inline `style={{ }}`. Reusable items in `apps/web/components/`.
- Client never cuts points. `POST /jobs` returns 202.
- Do not silently change ADRs. AIDLC: PO → SA → human gate → BE → FE → QA.
